# Go files stay LF in every checkout, Windows with core.autocrlf included:
# the gofmt and goimports formatters of go/.golangci.yml, and sqlc diff, read a
# CRLF file as unformatted or changed.
*.go text eol=lf

# The files Prettier checks stay LF too: its endOfLine default reads a CRLF
# checkout as unformatted.
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
